261 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 184 0 R
/E (The East Coast Showdown \(ECS\) Executive Board at the University of Virginia is proud to announce our tenth annual Bhangra and Garba-Raas competition! With the success of the past nine years, East Coast Showdown is excited to be even bigger and better this year. The competition will be held on February 20th, 2027 at the MLK Performing Arts Center in Charlottesville, VA. Our competition aims to increase awareness of South Asian culture while also uniting the community by showcasing these two different dance forms. We are proud to announce our continued partnership with Sakhi. All the proceeds of ECS 2027, net operating expenses, will be donated to Sakhi in order to support our international community. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
262 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 184 0 R
/E (Our executive board consists of individuals with dance experience from many different backgrounds who are excited to celebrate the diverse cultures of South Asia. We understand the hard work that goes into cultivating a team, and we would like to honor that by striving to provide one of the best experiences in the circuit while satisfying all teams' needs. We would like to thank you for your interest in ECS and would be honored to have your team participate in our competition. We can't wait to see what your team has to offer and bring you a weekend filled with fun, competition, and southern hospitality! )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
